    {
      "id": "claim_0c0c711bc0dc4894b6a14baefe82919e",
      "statement": "On a passing correction, the handler sets the remaining column (grams or units, chosen by which is not None) to counted and writes one barcode=None CORRECTION movement: direction IN with grams = counted - current when counted is higher (found stock), direction OUT with grams = current - counted when lower (missing stock).",
      "evidence": [
