    {
      "id": "claim_e3e4484b5e7f4f0e8d8e4ee9714176e3",
      "statement": "BatchRow derives daysUntil from expiry_date (date-only difference) and an urgencyLevel (expired below 0 days, critical at <= 3, soon at <= 10, else fresh) used as the row CSS modifier and days label; VarietySection lists each variety's batches sorted by expiry_date, filters to remaining stock above 0 (so emptied batches vanish), and sums the headline total only over batches with daysUntil >= 0 so expired batches stay listed for discard but don't count as sellable.",
