      "statement": "StockMovement.grams is an overloaded integer column across all five write paths (restock, scan, deduct, discard, correct): it carries grams for weight-tracked quantities and the unit count for unit-tracked quantities, so audit-trail consumers such as the low-stock script stay correct only while every handler keeps this convention.",
